Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 19:06:27 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix(sim): check bull-nose gouges in the finish envelope

Use the physical cutting atoms for straight upright moves and mark stock rest unmeasured. Pin the R1 false clearance against a true ball and the non-gouging R3 rail.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Refs #1531
